From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dbc-hbin <dion9310@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 01:21:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll, server: Fix msync.

Unchanged from hsr-wine-d3dmetal patches/wine-tuned (LGPL-2.1-or-later), applied in this
order: 0001-msync-tuned, 0003-msync-reliability, 0007-msync-resource-reuse and
0012-msync-shared-pages. Without them wineserver crashes releasing an fd's inproc sync object
when WINEMSYNC=1.

Topic: msync
---
